Canvas 排行榜布局=fun create.canvas(Canvas canvas@1@@3)
Long 排行榜种类=fun create.long(Long 0)
act 1101.this.排行榜'刷新顶部按钮()
if{fun create.bool(var 已初始化)
  act 1101.this.按钮颜色刷新()
  act 1101.this.积分榜刷新()
}
if{fun bool.not(var 已初始化)
  act 1101.this.按钮点击'周榜()
  Bool 已初始化=fun create.bool(Bool 1)
}
Bool 是GM=act 1101./主界面.工具'是GM()
